# libSceAgc — GPU command-buffer / shader ABI.
#
# EVERY name here becomes a POSITIONAL (unconditional DT_NEEDED) import from
# libSceAgc.prx in the eboot. A name whose NID does not resolve on the console
# firmware makes the dynamic loader REJECT the whole module -> "Game or App
# Error" / CE-108255-1 before main(), no log ("crashed before KStuff pause").
#
# GL-6 (#82) deleted pp_agc.c (the hand-rolled sceAgc present/geo/OSD path), so
# this file no longer lists symbols directly. --gl is the only app-module build
# and ps5-opengl's Gallium driver imports sceAgc* itself; package-app.sh
# harvests those from the ps5-opengl archives (GL_SCE_UNDEF) and appends them to
# this stub's generated .c, so the stub stays populated and NEEDED without a
# hand-maintained (and easily-stale, easily-bricking) list here.
#
# Add an explicit symbol below ONLY if an EVO object imports it directly and it
# is not already in the ps5-opengl set (a link error will name it).
